 website/docs/developer-guide/cron-internals.md                | 2 +-
 website/docs/user-guide/bot-mode.md                           | 2 +-
 .../current/user-guide/bot-mode.md                            | 4 ++--
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

